  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts and shio-koji, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 5 minutes, stirring frequently, until the sprouts are tender and lightly browned.",
    "Remove from heat and garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
